# One shell + one Claude-TUI + one claude-auth-login preset per SSH_MACHINES
# entry, generated rather than hand-written per machine so a third machine is
# one SSH_MACHINES entry, not six more of these. No AIGW_OUTBOX for any of
# these: these machines share no filesystem with this host (unlike the
# container, which is bind-mounted), so there is nowhere for an outbox file
# to land. cwd (and, once one is chosen, resume) is the one exception, and
# only for the Claude preset on a machine whose SSH_MACHINES entry sets
# "drives": True (winbox-a/winbox-b, not linuxbox) -- see CWD_PRESETS below,
# resolve_ssh_workdir (the deployment notes), and list_ssh_claude_
